WGeBmSpaIZaZMbVB7uFaZPQscQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0AZV0E_mN2tYFPfoGAWID9Bq5MJrrbtSK15xnwsZZAYw&oe=69F09E91"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ReelCoverArt.png", "id": "26331318676464896", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310817_26331318679798229_3163663610629890871_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GHMfVqdWHhoQ7kNvwFGsNiB&_nc_oc=AdrZ7XZsQ80lmVKNjfQS378BK39K8KTJG6Hxls4FqY79j95KrfcJcRPbq7XzNMR47Ws&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1QCH5f2PKFGRH9pNcb_YOBZf99bYsydN371uQdgEpl8Q&oe=69F0B9AC"}, "display_name": "Spacious Places", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Spacious Places offers scenic environments to destress and decompress, surrounded by the beauty and the sounds of nature: \n  - Mountains\n  - Desert\n  - River\n  - Grassland\n  - Forest\n  - Tropics\n  - Jungle\nThe app features an array of virtual instruments that you can play, creating your own virtual sound bath, no musical training required.\n  - Harps\n  - Chimes\n  - Bells\n  - Gong\n  - Congas\n  - Drums\n  - Vibraphone\n  - Xylophones\n  - Handpan\n  - Tank Drum\n  - Kalimba\n  - Balafon\nThe sounds and scenery in these spacious places will transport you to a place of peace, calm and tranquility.", "short_description": "Spacious Places blends music and instruments with beautiful scenery to promote restfulness and improve your wellbeing. Journey through hand-crafted worlds and play along with peaceful songs using a variety of virtual instruments. Relax and take a breath, surrounded by nature's embrace, listen to the healing sounds and escape to spacious places."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://spaciousplaces.ai/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Spacious Music LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://spaciousplaces.ai/index.html", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST"